name: claims_network
description: "Claims network - claimants linked by shared claims, accidents, phones and addresses, and to the garage, clinic and lawyer on their claims (claims_links_dataset). Seed the repeat passenger (see the runbook) and expand: the staged-accident ring is one community of 12 claimants and three providers; the busy GP clinic CLI-01 is held on expand and is not the ring."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: claims_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[1]: via
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
